    <h1>The shop.</h1>
    <p class="lumen-lead">Lumen is Ray Martinez, Vivian Cho, and Omar Patel. A master electrician, a journeyman, and an apprentice working out of a garage shop on Linden. Ray founded Lumen in 2014 after 14 years with a larger commercial house.</p>
